{"id":"n65200-6-3","stage":1,"title":"가깝다 · 近","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65200-6-3-1","ko":"방금 전에 네 고모라는 분한테서 전화가 왔었어.","zh":"刚才有位自称是你姑姑的人打过电话来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才。","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"고모라는","meaning":"姑姑，姑妈","explanation":"고모：姑姑，姑妈；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"고모","audio":"/audio/d49288d6a739a8dd2b31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20052","senseId":"1","lemma":"고모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고모라는","audio":"/audio/7ae0e8856729dec09e7e.mp3"}},{"text":"분한테서","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；한테서：口语中表示“从某人那里”。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분한테서","audio":"/audio/3aa3e033e0a022def28f.mp3"}},{"text":"전화가","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：电话；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화가","audio":"/audio/ec4fb69ab983651b2225.mp3"}},{"text":"왔었어.","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔었어","audio":"/audio/85d21fc1a77d612f8b74.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"比一定时期早。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"d49288d6a739a8dd","term":"고모","zh":"姑姑，姑妈","audio":"/audio/d49288d6a739a8dd2b31.mp3","entryId":"20052","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["고모"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"人们通过电话机交谈；或指通过那样传达的内容。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a0fea07bf2e396f3cb34.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65200-6-3-2","ko":"이상하다. 내 가까운 친척이라고는 삼촌뿐인데.","zh":"真奇怪，我亲近的亲戚只有叔叔而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이상하다.","meaning":"奇怪，古怪","explanation":"이상하다：奇怪，古怪；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71167","senseId":"2","lemma":"이상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상하다","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"가까운","meaning":"近","explanation":"가깝다：近；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가깝다","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65200","senseId":"6","lemma":"가깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가까운","audio":"/audio/ae733feeb8d75aeaad68.mp3"}},{"text":"친척이라고는","meaning":"亲戚","explanation":"친척：亲戚；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친척","audio":"/audio/8bace21fb6009284a497.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72158","senseId":"1","lemma":"친척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친척이라고는","audio":"/audio/819ad51b139a3b60fe21.mp3"}},{"text":"삼촌뿐인데.","meaning":"叔叔，舅舅","explanation":"삼촌：叔叔，舅舅；뿐：限定范围，表示“只有、仅仅”；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61142","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼촌뿐인데","audio":"/audio/75385a55b2573e793b89.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8ccfeb4ba6659178","term":"이상하다","zh":"奇怪，古怪","audio":"/audio/8ccfeb4ba665917849ed.mp3","entryId":"71167","definition":"和原本知道的东西不同，特别或独特。","pronunciation":["이ː상하다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9ff63e71387c2c60","term":"가깝다","zh":"近","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3","entryId":"65200","definition":"辈分不远。","pronunciation":["가깝따"]},{"id":"8bace21fb6009284","term":"친척","zh":"亲戚","audio":"/audio/8bace21fb6009284a497.mp3","entryId":"72158","definition":"与父母或配偶有血缘关系的人。","pronunciation":["친척"]},{"id":"5d1a410b7ca871d4","term":"삼촌","zh":"叔叔，舅舅","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3","entryId":"61142","definition":"用于指称或称呼父母的兄弟。","pronunciation":["삼촌"]}],"audio":"/audio/97027bdfaceda7c58373.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.845,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65200","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1852,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["刚才有位自称是你姑姑的人打过电话来。","刚才有位自称你姨妈的人打过电话。","刚才我给你姑姑打了一通电话。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我亲近的亲戚除了叔叔还有姑姑。","真奇怪，我亲近的亲戚只有叔叔而已。","我和所有亲戚都很亲近，并不奇怪。"],"answer":1}]}
